<title>GERMANY: Allianz targets 15 pct return on capital.</title>
<headline>Allianz targets 15 pct return on capital.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance group Allianz AG Holding said on Monday it was targeting a return on capital of 15 percent by the end of the decade, up from the current level of 11.2 percent.</p>
<p>Addressing shareholders at the group's annual general meeting, Schulte-Noelle said Allianz was still far from its goals on return on capital and that its net return on sales of three percent was well below that of its international rivals.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
